{
  "name": "ondra-emotion-hormone",
  "description": "空谷 Ondra 的激素维度扩展（手册 §3.2 / §14.3，默认关闭）：把皮质醇、多巴胺、催产素读成「压着事 / 轻快 / 挨得近」三档倾向，与核心三维并存但**只读叠加**——不持有任何激素、不写 PAD、不算第二套 mood、不出提示词片段。oxytocin 走 O-026 自己的动态激素通道（inflict + 通用基线 50 / 30 分钟），本插件一个字段都不新增。",
  "version": "0.1.0",
  "private": true,
  "type": "module",
  "main": "lib/index.js",
  "types": "lib/index.d.ts",
  "exports": {
    ".": {
      "types": "./lib/index.d.ts",
      "default": "./lib/index.js"
    },
    "./cordis.patch.yml": "./cordis.patch.yml",
    "./locale/*.json": "./locale/*.json",
    "./icon": "./icon.svg",
    "./src/*": "./src/*",
    "./package.json": "./package.json"
  },
  "files": [
    "lib/**/*.js",
    "lib/**/*.d.ts",
    "cordis.patch.yml",
    "locale/*.json",
    "icon.svg",
    "README.md"
  ],
  "license": "AGPL-3.0",
  "ondra": {
    "bundle": {
      "patch": "./cordis.patch.yml"
    }
  },
  "peerDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~"
  },
  "devDependencies": {
    "@ntars/cordis": "workspace:~",
    "@types/node": "22.20.1"
  }
}
